t (`CODEX_API_KEY`), so it\nneeds nothing from the home folder.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":17,"oldLines":6,"newStart":17,"newLines":10,"lines":[" Lanes:"," "," - `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.","+- `codex-sandboxed`: the same Codex run, under the same profile and scratch","+  HOME as `kimi`. Codex gets a scratch `CODEX_HOME` holding copies of","+  `auth.json`, `config.toml` and `installation_id` from `~/.codex`; the real","+  `~/.codex` stays closed to the sandbox."," - `kimi`: Kimi Code. Its output goes to Moonshot, so its shell runs under the","   macOS sandbox profile `sandbox/agent.sb` (no reading or writing the real","   home), with an empty scratch HOME. Kimi's own install and sessions live in"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016Z5pAoojK3568bjx1M2eS5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
